    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128680/extras/2de963d8860c341ba3233784d3f94390.avif?t=1703238803\" /></div>.<br>A mere toe in the future.<br>Yomori-shi, a town full of strange happenings.<br><br>There, a strange visitor appears.<br>And Ayamu Jinnai, who lives in the town, is just an ordinary girl.<br>Except that she is a powerful medium and has the ability to see spirits.<br>She and her occult-enthusiast sister, Makoto Jinnai, are going to confront the bizarre!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128680/extras/a0b51ec8ee3de4044b015f922388ee05.avif?t=1703238803\" /></div>.<br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ayama Jinnai</h2></strong></u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128680/extras/26896717ba9e70bfaceb6a9956321db3.avif?t=1703238803\" /></div>.<br>The protagonist of this work<br>She is a &quot;psychic girl&quot; with powerful psychic vision and a mediumistic constitution.<br>She uses her abilities to solve bizarre cases with both of her sisters.<br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Makoto Jinnai</h2></strong></u>[/img<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128680/extras/7779c593d34c2d1b01391f707fad2eac.avif?t=1703238803\" /></div>.<br>Occult enthusiast and martial artist.<br>Ayama's sister who is undefeated in 7 kickboxing fights.<br>She can't see any spirits, but she uses her physicality and occult knowledge to fight the weird.<br><br><br>This is an adventure novel with occult and horror elements.<br>The story is told through point-and-click exploration, the use of items and ability icons such as &quot;spirit vision,&quot; and choices.<br>The story is told through choices you make.<br>The difficulty level is quite low, and the game progresses quickly with an emphasis on the story experience.<br>There are a few branches, but it is almost a one-way adventure novel.",
